{"title":"fea.ConjugateHeatTransferInterface.resistance","category":"fea","keywords":["fea","interface","fluid","thermal","resistance"],"summary":"Join fluid and solid regions through a finite thermal resistance.","requires_feature":"fea","tested":{"unit":"builtins::fea::interfaces::tests","integration":null},"description":"Defines conjugate heat transfer using one positive typed area-normalized thermal resistance.","behaviors":["Requires `fea.ThermalContactResistance`.","The transfer law is stored without a redundant conductance.","Use `perfect` rather than zero resistance."],"examples":[{"description":"Create resistance-controlled transfer","input":"r = fea.ThermalContactResistance.squareMeterKelvinPerWatt(0.002);\ncht = fea.ConjugateHeatTransferInterface.resistance(\"wall-heat\", fluidWall, solidWall, r);"}],"faqs":[],"links":[{"label":"FEA models","url":"../../fea/models"}],"source":{"label":"`crates/runmat-runtime/src/builtins/fea/interfaces.rs`","url":"https://github.com/runmat-org/runmat/blob/main/crates/runmat-runtime/src/builtins/fea/interfaces.rs"}}
